WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Trying to work out where the gap is?

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:12.600
Every company's feature page says everything is included.

3
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.600
Same rows, same questions, one grid.

4
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:24.600
Only Freshroute plans delivery routes. Barnwise says it does not.

5
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:30.600
A row where a competitor says no is a row you could win on.

6
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:38.600
A question mark means we looked and nobody said either way.

7
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:44.600
That is not a no. It is a question they have never answered in public.

8
00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:52.600
A triangle means a rival claimed it, not the company.

9
00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:58.900
Competitors describe each other badly. Worth knowing before you repeat it.

10
00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:03.900
Five things a box can mean. Most comparisons manage two.

11
00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:07.900
What changed recently is next.
